<title>UK: Toronto-Dominion sets C$200 mln bond.</title>
<headline>Toronto-Dominion sets C$200 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto-Dominion Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TORONTO-DOMINION BANK</p>
<p> AMT    C$200 MLN     COUPON     6.625     MATURITY    07.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.19    PAY DATE    07.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.59     SPREAD	+37 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	=</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/AA    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ONT/CAN   HOME CTRY  CANADA    TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
